  {
   "id": "do-you-even-forklift-347479@post-2026-10-20",
   "gameId": "do-you-even-forklift-347479",
   "displayName": "Do You even Forklift? latest patch notes + Meet us on PGA 2026!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-20T13:53:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes are Here",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A little while ago, we released a new patch with a bunch of fixes and improvements to make your experience smoother and the hunt a bit more challenging! Here's what's changed:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Soups no longer have speech bubbles, making them a bit more challenging to find!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several translation issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed color issues in the first level with trees.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed collision issues across multiple levels, especially with the crusher, based on reported feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The crusher now correctly turns off the alarm after crushing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a level selection menu to the overview map, including indicators showing whether the cat and soup have been found in each level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Skipped levels are now marked on the overview map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed soup and cat counters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed in-game input hints to ensure they work correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "See You at PGA 2026!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're also happy to invite you to visit our booth at PGA 2026! Come say hi, chat with us, give us a high five, and try out our latest games. We'd love to meet you there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44275240/e422d34d8cc1160d51ccbbccb454a0f95027911e.png\"]Our booth from last year!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
