  {
   "id": "do-you-even-forklift-347479@post-2026-08-10",
   "gameId": "do-you-even-forklift-347479",
   "displayName": "See What’s New in Plumber Simulator! 🔧💧",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-10T12:43:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A while ago, we introduced you to our next major project — Plumber Simulator! 🔧💧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4625610/Plumber_Simulator/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since then, development has been moving forward, and we've started regularly sharing devlogs, behind-the-scenes updates, new features, and development progress directly on the Plumber Simulator Steam page.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you enjoyed Electrician Simulator and you're curious to see what we're working on next, we'd love for you to stop by and check out our latest updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There's already plenty to see, and we'll be sharing much more as development continues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉 Visit the Plumber Simulator Steam page, check out our devlogs, and follow the game to stay up to date!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "You can find newest devlog here!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "See you there! 💧🔧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "~Take IT Studio! Developers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
